<title>USA: COMAIR adds jet service to Toledo.</title>
<headline>COMAIR adds jet service to Toledo.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>COMAIR Inc said on Monday it will introduce a third jet flight between Toledo Express Airport and its hub at Cincinnati/Northern Kentucky International Airport beginning May 1.</p>
<p>With the jet upgrade, three of COMAIR's seven daily non-stop, round-trip flights between the two cities will be flown with Bombardier Inc Canadair Jet, COMAIR said.</p>
</text>
